{{also|short stop|short-stop}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|short|stop}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|baseball}} The [[infield]] defensive [[player]] that stands between the [[second baseman]] and the [[third baseman]].
#: {{ux|en|The '''shortstop''' ranged deep into the hole to make the stop.}}
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} A nimble defender.
#: {{ux|en|I'll play '''shortstop''' when we make our proposal.}}
# {{lb|en|gambling}} A [[player]] who is short of money.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1981|author=Sam Grafstein|title=Dice Doctor
|passage=The '''shortstops''' and desperados were not permitted to play in this marker crap game.}}

